# Multimodal Political Emotion Intelligence (PoliEmotiFusion)

This repository contains the multimodal deep learning emotion analysis system for political discourse across **Text**, **Image**, **Audio**, and **Video**.

---

## ⚡ Quick Start: Running the Frontend

To launch the full web application:

```bash
# 1. Navigate to the frontend directory
cd frontend

# 2. Install dependencies (required on first run)
npm install

# 3. Start the development server
npm run dev
```

Then open your browser at **`http://localhost:5173`**.

